IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g7-interpretation`
IMPORT `g7-vintages`
IMPORT `g7-commencement`

-- g7-tests-commencement: the staged commencement of the Law and the renumbering.  The expected values were decided from the Table of Legislation History (row L.41/2014: stage 1 21 November 2014,
-- stage 2 1 May 2018, remainder 1 January 2019), the Table of Renumbered Provisions and R&O.17/2018 Articles 1 and 2 before this module was run.
-- Original numbers: stage 1 = Articles 1-7 (Parts 1 to 3), 32, 38, 39, 40, 42, 43, 44 and the Schedules; stage 2 = 8-20 (Parts 4, 5), 26-31 (Part 7), 33-36 (Part 8 other than Article 32), 37;
-- stage 3 = the remainder = 21-25 (Part 6) and the original 41.  Present numbers by the renumbering: 41, 42, 43 are the original 42, 43, 44 (stage 1).

§ `Commencement and renumbering -- tests`

`fav` MEANS `the favoured interpretation`
`other F7.3` MEANS `the interpretation with the other reading of F7.3`
`other F7.9` MEANS `the interpretation with the other reading of F7.9`
`other F7.11` MEANS `the interpretation with the other reading of F7.11`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      mo IS A NUMBER
      d IS A NUMBER
      h IS A NUMBER
      mi IS A NUMBER
      s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATETIME
`an instant in Jersey` y mo d h mi s MEANS
    DATETIME_FROM_DTZ (YMD y mo d) (TIME_FROM_HMS h mi s) "Europe/Jersey"

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      mo IS A NUMBER
      d IS A NUMBER
      h IS A NUMBER
      mi IS A NUMBER
      s IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATETIME
`an instant in UTC` y mo d h mi s MEANS
    DATETIME_FROM_DTZ (YMD y mo d) (TIME_FROM_HMS h mi s) "Etc/UTC"

