-- Parts 8 and 9 each straddle stages.  Part 8: Article 32 (stage 1) and Articles 33 to 36 (stage 2).  Part 9: Articles 38 to 43 (stage 1), Article 37 (stage 2) and the spent original Article 41 (stage 3, the remainder).
-- On the reading taken a Part is in force only when ALL the Articles it held are; on the other reading (F7.9) when ANY is.
